  "full_response": "**Incident Report: Unauthorized External Sharing of INTERNAL_ONLY Documents**\n\n**Incident Title:** Unauthorized External Sharing of INTERNAL_ONLY Documents\n**Report Date:** [Insert Date]\n**Reported By:** [Your Name/Title]\n**Incident Date & Time:** [Insert Date & Time]\n**Location:** [Office/Remote Work Environment]\n**Affected Employee:** [Employee Name/ID]\n**Department:** [Department Name]\n\n---\n\n### **Incident Summary**\nOn [Incident Date], an employee ([Employee Name]) inadvertently shared documents classified as **INTERNAL_ONLY** with an external recipient. The **INTERNAL_ONLY** classification is reserved for sensitive company information that must not be disclosed outside the organization without proper authorization. This incident represents a breach of data security protocols and the company’s **INTERNAL_ONLY** classification policy.\n\n---\n\n### **Incident Details**\n1. **Nature of the Incident:**\n   - The employee attached and sent **INTERNAL_ONLY** documents via email to an external contact (e.g., vendor, client, or personal email).\n   - The documents were labeled with the **INTERNAL_ONLY** classification, which should have prevented external sharing.\n\n2. **How the Incident Occurred:**\n   - The employee mistakenly included the **INTERNAL_ONLY** documents in an email intended for external distribution.\n   - Possible contributing factors:\n     - Lack of double-checking attachments before sending.\n     - Misunderstanding of the **INTERNAL_ONLY** classification restrictions.\n     - Insufficient training on handling **INTERNAL_ONLY** materials.\n\n3. **Discovery of the Incident:**\n   - The error was identified when [describe how it was discovered, e.g., \"the external recipient replied asking for confirmation,\" \"a DLP (Data Loss Prevention) alert was triggered,\" or \"a supervisor noticed during a routine review\"].\n\n4. **Impact:**\n   - **Data Exposure:** The **INTERNAL_ONLY** documents contained [describe type of information, e.g., \"financial projections,\" \"employee data,\" \"strategic plans\"].\n   - **Risk Level:** [Low/Medium/High] – Assess based on sensitivity of the **INTERNAL_ONLY** content and potential consequences (e.g., reputational damage, regulatory violations).\n   - **Recipients:** [Number of external parties involved, e.g., \"1 vendor\" or \"3 external email addresses\"].\n\n---\n\n### **Immediate Actions Taken**\n1. **Cont",
